From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tau <noreply@tau.new>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:04:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] core: stage writer archives in memory on
 wasm32-unknown-unknown

The Fusion, FreeCAD and Rhino writers assemble their archives in an
anonymous temporary file. On wasm32-unknown-unknown there is no
filesystem: tempfile::tempfile() panics in std::env::temp_dir. Add
cadmpeg_core::io::staging_buffer(), which keeps the temporary file on
native targets and uses an in-memory cursor where no filesystem exists,
and use it at the four staging sites.
